  "synopsis": "Thomas Anderson is an ordinary office worker by day and a hacker named Neo by night. One day, a mystical figure named Morpheus approaches him and offers to learn the truth about the world. Morpheus offers him two pills - a red one and a blue one; taking the blue one means he will wake up at home and remember nothing, while taking the red one will give him answers. Neo chooses the red one and discovers that all of humanity is connected to a virtual world - the Matrix. Their bodies are used as a source of energy for artificial intelligence. However, there are those like Morpheus who have managed to escape and want to save humanity from slavery. There is a prophecy that the One will appear, who can defeat the Matrix and the machines, and Morpheus believes that Neo is the One. Agents—programs under the control of the Matrix—will stand in their way, particularly one of them—Agent Smith.",
